  "description_short": "Warm community cafe in Thembalethu serving honest home-style cooking and friendly local atmosphere.",
  "description_long": "Tucked away in George's Thembalethu township, 24th Cafe brings genuine warmth and home-cooked flavours to the neighbourhood. This is where locals gather for hearty meals that feel like they've come straight from a family kitchen, served with the kind of hospitality that makes everyone feel welcome.\n\nThe menu focuses on traditional South African favourites and everyday comfort food, prepared with care and generous portions. It's the sort of place where you can settle in for a proper breakfast or lunch, chat with regulars, and experience authentic township life away from the tourist trail. The cafe's strong community spirit and consistently high ratings from locals speak to its genuine appeal and quality cooking.",
